ot very bright, proving the <a href=\"/wiki/Miner%27s_Helmet\" title=\"Miner&#39;s Helmet\">Miner's Helmet</a> to be a much better alternative.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163316\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 51/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019472/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.674      1 Template:UGC\n100.00%   40.674      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2500-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163316 and revision id 15045. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["UGC","Items"],"links":[{"title":"Lantern","exists":true},{"title":"Miner's Helmet","exists":true}],"images":["Head_Lantern.png","Head_Lantern_I.G.png"]}
